优化周期一周专注极致[cos滑稽]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/72ef2f4e9b97336d4c83ef2b3cb5abda.jpg&quot; &gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://10.0.0.1:50108/coolapk_img/fd2a9fd702b074d6e317249ef010b30c.jpg&quot; &gt;</description><link>https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72555122</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.coolapk.com/feed/72555122</guid><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 19:41:45 GMT</pubDate><author>桔氢</author></item><item><title>#小风扇# #DIY# 单位太热了，连夜搓一个12038风扇支架，搭配7000转的Nidec[doge] —— 实际上我之前在用更好用的平流者【图文】3D打印暴力风扇：平流者 V1 Neo.....</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/%E5%B0%8F%E9%A3%8E%E6%89%87?type=0&quot;&gt;#小风扇#&lt;/a&gt;  &lt;a class=&quot;feed-link-tag&quot; href=&quot;https://www.coolapk.com/t/DIY?type=0&quot;&gt;#DIY#&lt;/a&gt; 单位太热了，连夜搓一个12038风扇支架，搭配7000转的Nidec[doge]
